{
    "background_story": "Kanan was a brilliant and fearless welder who worked on the most challenging construction projects in the city. His tool of choice was the acetylene torch, which he wielded with precision and artistry. With a flick of his wrist, Kanan could shape and mold metal into intricate works of art. His passion for welding was ignited by his father, a master craftsman who had taught him the trade. Kanan's expertise with acetylene earned him a reputation as one of the best in the business, and his services were in high demand. Whether working on a skyscraper or a delicate sculpture, Kanan's attention to detail and mastery of the acetylene torch made him a true master of his craft.",
